  /// SERVICE_CODE can only be used in CostCategoryRule . PRODUCT_ATTRIBUTE
  /// returns the product attribute keys that are available for your costs of
  /// supported services, or the values of the key that you specify in
  /// DimensionKey . PRODUCT_ATTRIBUTE is supported only in the COST_AND_USAGE
  /// context.
  pub dimension: Dimension? = None
